            "text": "Recovery may depend as much on how work ends as on how long we rest.",
            "research_insight": "Our observations suggest that recovery is influenced not only by the duration of rest, but by whether the transition out of work is clearly recognised. When the end of one state remains ambiguous, the beginning of the next may also become less distinct.",
